  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Change Makers - Alliance Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By supporting women &#x2013; and promoting dialogue among and between them &#x2013; the programme will seek to ensure that women change agents from all ages and backgrounds work towards a more just, peaceful, and inclusive society.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formal and informal networks of activists; women&apos;s groups; civil society leaders; traditional religious and community leaders; local officials; international and regional actors.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific objectives: 1) The women&#x2019;s movement is more inclusive for creating social change; 2) Traditional gender norms are challenged by new gender values, behaviors, and practices; 3) Women&#x2019;s participation is more diverse and legitimate in peacebuilding.</narrative>
  </description>
